flowchart TD
    C[Approved campaign] --> A[Audit verified capabilities]
    A --> H[Generate and register hypotheses]
    H --> B[Bounded Send preparation batches]
    B --> D[Deterministic capability check]
    D --> S[Construct immutable draft specification]
    S --> CXT[Assemble bounded typed critic context]
    CXT --> CR{Methodological critic}
    CR -->|REVISE at most twice| REV[Revise specification within original scope]
    REV --> CXT
    CR -->|ADMIT advisory| AD[Deterministic methodological admission]
    CR -->|Unsupported or exhausted| TF[Terminal research finding]
    D -->|Missing capability| TF
    AD -->|Blocked| TF
    AD -->|Admitted| FR[Freeze and register experiment]
    FR --> E[One durable experiment thread]
    E --> Q[Qualification and compilation]
    Q --> V[Baseline and implementation verification]
    V --> J[Register budget and outbox]
    J --> I[Interrupt for external job]
    I --> R[Verified ingestion and robustness]
    R --> RS[Replication-support role]
    RS --> X[Independent artifact reconstruction]
    X --> F[Deterministic grade and memory]
    F --> ALL[Await all authoritative findings]
    TF --> ALL
    ALL --> Y[Registry-based campaign synthesis]
    Y --> ST[Campaign steward and terminal report]
    ST --> P{Eligible frozen finalist batch?}
    P -->|No| T[Exploratory terminal evidence]
    P -->|Yes| U[Protected confirmation subgraph]
    U --> K[Authorization interrupt]
    K --> L[Sealed evaluation and Holm correction]
    L --> Z[Signed result and superseding finding]
    Q -->|Missing data| F
    V -->|Implementation failure| F
